 profile until separately analyzed and added to CI.
 
+The Desktop-local adaptation additionally compiles the exact Electron 44.7.2
+fingerprint (Node 24.21.0, V8 15.2.124.37-electron.0) on Windows x64 only.
+Its `require-builtin` N-API v9 binary passes ordinary Node and real Electron
+Node-mode backend tests, including real CJS/ESM/Realm access. Exact-fingerprint
+positive and negative cases also pass. The `require-builtin` real main-process
+check also passes in [Desktop Windows CI](https://github.com/KouzakiUmi/dsh-desktop/actions/runs/38767386908/job/116534305328).
+This is not a supported cell in the table above, not an npm release, and not a
+claim for `internal-loader` or other platforms.
